---
const pageTitle = 'Cotonou + Ouidah, Benin — Itinerary';
const description = 'A practical three-day guide to Cotonou and Ouidah, with hotel, transport, food, and payment notes.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300..600;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <header class="hero">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Travel notes · 3-day itinerary</p>
          <h1>Cotonou <span>+</span> Ouidah</h1>
          <p class="country">Benin</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">
          <p>A relaxed city-and-coast trip with a full day in Ouidah, a hotel reset, and a flexible day around Cotonou.</p>
          <div class="tags" aria-label="Trip themes">
            <span>Culture</span><span>Beach</span><span>Food</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="quick-facts" aria-label="Quick facts">
        <div><span>Base</span><strong>Sofitel Cotonou Marina</strong></div>
        <div><span>Currency</span><strong>West African CFA</strong></div>
        <div><span>Driver</span><strong>105,000 XOF / day</strong></div>
        <div><span>Useful</span><strong>Cash + Google Translate</strong></div>
      </section>

      <div class="content-grid">
        <article>
          <section class="story-section intro">
            <div class="section-number">01</div>
            <div>
              <p class="section-label">Where I stayed</p>
              <h2>Sofitel Cotonou Marina Hotel &amp; Spa</h2>
              <p>I stayed in a sea-view room with breakfast for about <strong>1,000,000 XOF</strong> (around <strong>$1,880</strong>). Even if you enter a card while booking online, it may not be charged—I still had to pay in person at the hotel.</p>
              <p>The hotel has enough going on for an entire day: multiple restaurants and bars, a spa, indoor and outdoor pools, a cinema, and a club/lounge. The ground-floor bar gets lively at night. You do not need to be a guest to book many of the restaurants and facilities.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="story-section">
            <div class="section-number">02</div>
            <div>
              <p class="section-label">Getting there</p>
              <h2>Lagos to Cotonou</h2>
              <p>I booked a GX460 through <strong>Benify for ₦450,000</strong>, plus <strong>₦10,000</strong> for stamps and border assistance. Someone met us at the border to help with stamps, exchanging money, and the general process.</p>
              <div class="money-row">
                <div><span>Exchanged</span><strong>₦580,000</strong></div>
                <div class="arrow">→</div>
                <div><span>Received</span><strong>≈ 255,000 XOF</strong></div>
              </div>
              <p>A local SIM and data cost around <strong>7,000 XOF</strong>. Having cash is useful, especially once you leave the hotel.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="day-card">
            <div class="day-heading">
              <div><span>Day</span><strong>01</strong></div>
              <div><p class="section-label">Ouidah</p><h2>History, art &amp; the coast</h2></div>
              <p class="time">11:30 AM pickup</p>
            </div>
            <ol class="stops">
              <li><span>01</span>Point of No Return</li>
              <li><span>02</span>Fondation Zinsou</li>
              <li><span>03</span>Python Temple</li>
              <li><span>04</span>Ouidah historical areas</li>
              <li><span>05</span>Ouidah Sur Mer <small>lunch + beach</small></li>
            </ol>
            <p class="note">I swapped Casa Del Papa for Ouidah Sur Mer. This was enough for one day—I would not try to cram much more in.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="day-card hotel-day">
            <div class="day-heading">
              <div><span>Day</span><strong>02</strong></div>
              <div><p class="section-label">Hotel day</p><h2>Slow down at Sofitel</h2></div>
            </div>
            <div class="activity-grid">
              <div><span>SPA</span><strong>30,000–70,000 XOF</strong><p>Depends on the treatment. My room included 30 complimentary sauna minutes; spa payment also included indoor pool access.</p></div>
              <div><span>CINEMA</span><strong>≈ 15,000 XOF</strong><p>An easy add-on without leaving the hotel.</p></div>
              <div><span>SUNSET DRINKS</span><strong>≈ 45,000 XOF</strong><p>At Corniche for four shots and two cocktails.</p></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="day-card">
            <div class="day-heading">
              <div><span>Day</span><strong>03</strong></div>
              <div><p class="section-label">Cotonou</p><h2>Landmarks with room to wander</h2></div>
              <p class="time">11:30 AM pickup</p>
            </div>
            <ol class="stops two-column">
              <li><span>01</span>Amazone Esplanade</li>
              <li><span>02</span>Port graffiti wall</li>
              <li><span>03</span>Bio Guera Monument</li>
              <li><span>04</span>Art Market</li>
              <li><span>05</span>Abandoned plane</li>
              <li><span>06</span>Corniche</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="note"><strong>Unplanned additions:</strong> Super U, quad biking at Family Beach, and a local Nigerian restaurant. Leave some room in the day—it is easy to add stops once you are out.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="story-section compact">
            <div class="section-number">03</div>
            <div>
              <p class="section-label">Nightlife</p>
              <h2>Byblos <span class="status">Planned</span></h2>
              <p>An upscale club, so the total depends entirely on how much you want to spend.</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </article>

        <aside>
          <section class="side-card">
            <p class="section-label">Food guide</p>
            <h2>What meals cost</h2>
            <ul class="price-list">
              <li><span>Nuggets &amp; fries</span><strong>6,000</strong></li>
              <li><span>Penne pasta</span><strong>8,000</strong></li>
              <li><span>Bolognese</span><strong>12,000</strong></li>
              <li><span>Burger</span><strong>24,000</strong></li>
              <li><span>Steak</span><strong>32,000</strong></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="currency">All prices in XOF</p>
            <div class="budget-callout">
              <span>Per person</span>
              <strong>15,000–25,000 XOF</strong>
              <p>For a normal meal. Budget 30,000–40,000 XOF+ for three courses and drinks.</p>
            </div>
            <p>There are plenty of hotel restaurants too. L’Ami is one of the nicer options.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="side-card dark">
            <p class="section-label">Getting around</p>
            <h2>Book the driver for big days.</h2>
            <p>I paid <strong>105,000 XOF per day</strong> for sightseeing. For shorter trips around Cotonou, taxis or Yango cost much less. A dedicated driver was worth it for Ouidah.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="side-card">
            <p class="section-label">Language</p>
            <h2>French helps—a lot.</h2>
            <p>Reception and concierge usually have at least one English speaker, but not everyone speaks it and details can get lost in translation. English is much less reliable in town, so keep Google Translate ready.</p>
            <p>I also met Femi at the hotel, who spoke Yoruba and made things easier for a bit.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="side-card accent-card">
            <p class="section-label">Paying for things</p>
            <h2>Tap inside. Cash outside.</h2>
            <p>Phone payments worked well around the hotel on both Pixel and iPhone 17. My GTBank card did not, though it has rarely worked properly abroad. There are two ATMs at the hotel.</p>
            <p>Outside the hotel, assume cash first. Many places favor cash or mobile money; Ouidah Sur Mer asked about MoMo before I paid cash.</p>
            <ul class="cash-list">
              <li>Attractions</li><li>Tips</li><li>Drivers</li><li>Markets</li><li>Smaller restaurants</li><li>Beach activities</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="side-card quiet-card">
            <p class="section-label">The atmosphere</p>
            <blockquote>“Classy, calm, and properly five star.”</blockquote>
            <p>Even with outside reservations for the bars, restaurants, and club, people were generally composed and respectful.</p>
          </section>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <footer>
        <span>Cotonou + Ouidah</span>
        <span>Benin travel notes</span>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { background: #e9e5dc; color: #20211e; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; }
  :global(p) { text-wrap: pretty; }
  .page { width: min(100%, 980px); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px); background: #fffefb; box-shadow: 0 3px 40px rgba(45, 42, 34, .12); }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr .65fr; gap: 48px; align-items: end; padding-bottom: 36px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #20211e; }
  .eyebrow, .section-label { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #96734e; font: 500 10px/1.4 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 82px); font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: .92; }
  h1 span { color: #c97846; font-style: italic; }
  .country { margin: 13px 0 0; color: #77746d; font: 400 15px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero-note { color: #65635d; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .hero-note p { margin: 0; }
  .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .tags span, .status { padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid #ded8cc; border-radius: 999px; color: #706b62; font: 500 9px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .quick-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr; border-bottom: 1px solid #dfdcd4; }
  .quick-facts div { padding: 20px 12px 20px 0; }
  .quick-facts span, .money-row span, .day-heading span, .activity-grid span, .budget-callout > span { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #99958c; font: 500 9px/1.3 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .quick-facts strong { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; }
  .content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.75fr) minmax(240px, .8fr); gap: 48px; margin-top: 42px; }
  article { min-width: 0; }
  .story-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .section-number { padding-top: 3px; color: #aaa69d; font: 400 10px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .story-section p:not(.section-label), .side-card p, .note { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #65635d; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.65; }
  p strong { color: #292a27; font-weight: 600; }
  .money-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center; margin: 20px 0; padding: 17px; background: #f5f1e8; }
  .money-row strong { font: 500 13px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .arrow { color: #b29d84; }
  .day-card { margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 26px; border: 1px solid #dedbd3; border-radius: 4px; }
  .day-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr auto; gap: 15px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .day-heading > div:first-child { border-right: 1px solid #dedbd3; }
  .day-heading > div:first-child strong { font: 500 20px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .day-heading h2 { margin: 0; }
  .day-heading .section-label { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .time { margin: 3px 0 0; color: #9b978e; font: 400 9px/1.3 'DM Mono', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .stops { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e2db; }
  .stops.two-column { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: 20px; }
  .stops li { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e2db; color: #42423e; font-size: 12px; }
  .stops li span { margin-right: 10px; color: #aaa69d; font: 400 9px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .stops small { float: right; color: #99958c; font-size: 10px; }
  .note { margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 13px; border-left: 2px solid #d29769; font-style: italic; }
  .hotel-day { background: #263a36; color: #fff; border: 0; }
  .hotel-day .section-label { color: #b3c8bd; }
  .hotel-day .day-heading > div:first-child { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.2); }
  .activity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); }
  .activity-grid > div { padding: 16px; background: #263a36; }
  .activity-grid span { color: #a6bcb1; }
  .activity-grid strong { display: block; min-height: 38px; font: 500 12px/1.4 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .activity-grid p { margin: 9px 0 0; color: #c3cec9; font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .compact { margin-top: 36px; }
  .compact h2 { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .status { color: #96734e; font-size: 8px; }
  aside { min-width: 0; }
  .side-card { margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 24px; background: #f2eee5; }
  .side-card h2 { font-size: 20px; }
  .price-list { margin: 20px 0 5px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .price-list li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #dad5ca; color: #5e5b55; font-size: 11px; }
  .price-list strong { color: #33332f; font: 500 10px/1.4 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .currency { text-align: right; font: 400 8px/1.3 'DM Mono', monospace !important; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .budget-callout { margin: 20px 0; padding: 16px; background: #fffefb; }
  .budget-callout strong { display: block; font: 500 13px/1.4 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .budget-callout p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 10.5px; }
  .dark { background: #20211e; color: #fff; }
  .dark .section-label { color: #b5a38d; }
  .dark p { color: #bbb9b2; }
  .dark p strong { color: #fff; }
  .accent-card { background: #e8d5c3; }
  .cash-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 18px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .cash-list li { padding: 5px 7px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.52); color: #5e5146; font: 500 8px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .quiet-card { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #dedbd3; }
  blockquote { margin: 16px 0; color: #3f403c; font: italic 300 22px/1.25 'DM Sans', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1.5px solid #20211e; color: #8b887f; font: 400 9px/1 'DM Mono', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    :global(body) { padding: 0; }
    .page { padding: 32px 22px; box-shadow: none; }
    .hero, .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .quick-facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .content-grid { margin-top: 32px; }
    .activity-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 460px) {
    .day-heading { grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; }
    .time { grid-column: 2; }
    .stops.two-column { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media print {
    :global(html), :global(body) { background: #fff; }
    :global(body) { padding: 0; }
    .page { width: 100%; box-shadow: none; }
    .day-card, .side-card, .story-section { break-inside: avoid; }
  }
</style>
